>> title: Za'atar
>> category: Spice Blends & Marinades
>> tags: levantine, sesame, sumac, spice blend, pantry
>> servings: 16
>> time: 15 min
>> step.1: toast in a dry skillet 4 min
>> step.2: rub through a sieve
>> step.3: toss together
>> step.4: stir in

Toast @sesame seeds{1/4%cup}(35 g) in a dry #skillet{} over medium heat, shaking often, until golden, about ~{4%min}.

Rub @dried thyme{1/4%cup}, @dried oregano{2%Tbs}, and @dried marjoram{1%Tbs} through a coarse #sieve{} to break up the stems.

Toss @&(~2)toasted sesame seeds{} with @&(~1)herbs{} and @ground sumac{3%Tbs}.

Stir @kosher salt{1%tsp} into @&(~1)za'atar{}.
